.\" This is the man page for gfsplit
.TH GFSPLIT "1" "February 2006" "2.0.0" "UserCommands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gfsplit \- split a file into a number of shares
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B gfsplit
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIINPUTFILE\fR [\fIOUTPUTSTEM\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Generate an \fIN\fR\-of\-\fIM\fR share of the \fIINPUTFILE\fR.
.TP
\fB\-n\fR \fIN\fR
the threshold for recombination
.TP
\fB\-m\fR \fIM\fR
the number of shares to generate
.PP
The \fIOUTPUTSTEM\fR if omitted will default to the name of the
\fIINPUTFILE\fR. The program defaults to a 3-of-5 share if not
otherwise instructed.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Written by Daniel Silverstone.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
